{"id":"66b904dce6adc7c4","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-hbl-p4-p6.md","title":"Derived Provability Conditions P4–P6","display":"lem-hbl-p4-p6 — Derived Provability Conditions P4–P6","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6","aliases":["92-lem-hbl-p4-p6"],"display":"lem-hbl-p4-p6 — Derived Provability Conditions P4–P6","source":"第 IX 章 p. 107（PDF 124）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-hbl-p4-p6"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-hbl-p4-p6</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hbl-p4-p6 — Derived Provability Conditions P4–P6"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 107（PDF 124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"466c532d80d46a83\" href=\"?note=466c532d80d46a83\" title=\"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate\">92-df-hbl-provability-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_B\">\\(\\Box_B\\)</span> 为上游闭句构造器。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hbl\\text{-}p4\\text{-}p6}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to Y)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY,\\\\\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to(Y\\to Z))&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to(\\Box_BY\\to\\Box_BZ),\\\\\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to(\\Box_BX\\to Y))&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hbl\\text{-}p4\\text{-}p6}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to Y)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY,\\\\\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to(Y\\to Z))&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to(\\Box_BY\\to\\Box_BZ),\\\\\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to(\\Box_BX\\to Y))&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>P4：对给定蕴涵用 P1，再用 P2 和 MP。P5：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to(Y\\to Z)\">\\(X\\to(Y\\to Z)\\)</span> 用 P4，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_B(Y\\to Z)\\to(\\Box_BY\\to\\Box_BZ)\">\\(\\Box_B(Y\\to Z)\\to(\\Box_BY\\to\\Box_BZ)\\)</span>。P6：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\to(\\Box_BX\\to Y)\">\\(X\\to(\\Box_BX\\to Y)\\)</span> 用 P5，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_BX\\to(\\Box_B\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY)\">\\(\\Box_BX\\to(\\Box_B\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY)\\)</span>；用 P3 消去中间项。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 107（PDF 124）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-hbl-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"466c532d80d46a83","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HBL}_{\\mathcal S}(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_B","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,Z\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}hbl\\text{-}p4\\text{-}p6}\\vdash\\quad\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to Y)&\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY,\\\\\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to(Y\\to Z))&\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to(\\Box_BY\\to\\Box_BZ),\\\\\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash X\\to(\\Box_BX\\to Y))&\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X\\to(Y\\to Z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_B(Y\\to Z)\\to(\\Box_BY\\to\\Box_BZ)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\to(\\Box_BX\\to Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_BX\\to(\\Box_B\\Box_BX\\to\\Box_BY)","display":false}],"bytes":1296,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0cf42030c298d08","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这里可用已给出的 HBL 条件选取直接的 $\\Pi_1$ 见证 $\\gamma=\\mathrm{Con}_G$，无需宣称一个尚未选出的对角图已经具有 $\\Sigma_1$ 复杂度。\n令 $\\Box X=\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})$，先用普通对角引理选一个 $g$，满足 $G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box g$。由 $G\\vdash\\neg\\bot_G$，$G\\vdash g\\to(\\Box g\\to\\bot_G)$。P6 给 $G\\vdash\\Box g\\to\\Box\\bot_G$，反置并用固定点得到 $G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\to g$。另一方面 $G\\vdash\\bot_G\\to g$，P4 给 $\\Box\\bot_G\\to\\Box g$，反置得 $G\\vdash g\\to\\mathrm{Con}_G$。因此 $G\\vdash g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_G$。\n再用 P4 得 $G\\vdash\\Box g\\leftrightarrow\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G$；合并双条件得到 $G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\Box\\mathrm{Con}_G$。它满足本库的 $\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G$ 定义。$\\mathrm{Con}_G$ 是一个闭句且为所选 $\\Sigma_1$ 可证性公式的否定，故属于 $\\Pi_1^G$。没有用普通相容性推出否定侧不可证，也没有声称所有可证等价固定点都同层。\n这一见证是原书第 IX 章 p.108 Theorem 2 的本地推论；P4/P6 的推导见[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]。证明在数学元层给出，不是机器核验。"},{"id":"f29382efb1ab3219","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是原书 P4。由外部 $G\\vdash\\varphi\\to\\psi$ 用 P1 得内部可证性，再用 P2 和 MP 得结论；仅有 P2 没有前件的 P1 内化不够。参见[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-hbl-provability-predicate]] → [[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]] → [[92-thm-abstract-lob]] → [[92-thm-abstract-second-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"02627be788793195","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-236","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-hbl-p4-p6]]"}],"outgoing":["466c532d80d46a83"]}